@startuml
actor Engineer
participant "Control Studio" as Studio
participant "control.parameters handler" as Handler
participant "Debug parameter registry" as Registry
participant "Owning runtime task" as Task
participant "Variable storage" as Storage
Engineer -> Studio: Review binding and complete candidate
Studio -> Handler: status(binding)
Handler -> Registry: Typed symbols and compiled metadata
Registry --> Studio: Program/binding/value revisions and observed values
Studio -> Handler: apply(expected revisions/values, candidate, review)
Handler -> Registry: Validate and queue one transaction
Registry --> Studio: pending (not applied)
Task -> Registry: Owning task boundary
Registry -> Storage: Recheck mode, values, types, ownership, forcing
Registry -> Registry: Check runtime revision and actual I/O provenance
Registry -> Storage: Stage all replacements then commit once
Task -> Storage: Execute controller
Task -> Registry: Confirm subsequent observed values
Registry --> Studio: applied or rejected with reason
Engineer -> Studio: Roll back reviewed change
Studio -> Handler: rollback(previous revision, same guards)
Handler -> Registry: Queue retained previous set through same boundary
@enduml
